From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: flange <flange@local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dts: rk3566-radxa-zero3: 启用 NPU（bus_npu / rknpu / rknpu_mmu）

rk3566-radxa-zero3.dtsi 只给 rknpu 设了 rknpu-supply，status 沿用
rk356x.dtsi 默认的 disabled（Radxa 官方改由 radxa-overlays 的
rk3568-npu-enable overlay 打开）。这里直接在 dtsi 打开，zero-3w 两个
WiFi 变体与 zero-3e 共用。

Zero 3 为 RK817 方案，GPU/NPU 共用 DCDC2（vdd_gpu），已由 bootloader
patch 0001-uboot-dts-enable-vdd-gpu-npu 在 U-Boot 阶段打开并设 0.9V，
内核 rknpu_mmu probe 打开 NPU 电源域时不再 ack 超时。bus_npu 供电
与 Radxa overlay 一致（bus-supply=vdd_logic、pvtm-supply=vdd_cpu）。
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-zero3.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-zero3.dtsi
index f6a6b5c3..eb7db15a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-zero3.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-zero3.dtsi
@@ -421,8 +421,19 @@ &rkvenc_mmu {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&bus_npu {
+	bus-supply = <&vdd_logic>;
+	pvtm-supply = <&vdd_cpu>;
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &rknpu {
 	rknpu-supply = <&vdd_gpu>;
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&rknpu_mmu {
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &saradc {
